Package: ltcodes
Type: Package
Title: Validate Lithuanian Personal, Company, VAT and Bank Account Codes
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Justas", "Arbatauskis", email = "info@kokybiskasvetaine.lt", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Vectorised checks for Lithuanian personal codes, company codes,
    VAT numbers and IBANs, and helpers that read the birth date and sex stored
    in a personal code. The company code check was tested against the open data
    of the Register Centre <https://www.registrucentras.lt/p/1094>.
